*filter
:INPUT ACCEPT [0:0]
:FORWARD ACCEPT [0:0]
:OUTPUT ACCEPT [0:0]

# The gateway forwards every zone-to-zone packet unconditionally. There is no
# rule distinguishing the public web path from the internal database and file
# services behind it, so anything reachable through this host is reachable in
# full - the DMZ, the database, and the file share are effectively one flat
# network from a forwarding perspective.
COMMIT
